OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 2 Nov to Wed 11 Nov
OL,6,FHigh pressure is set to dominate the
OL,7,FUK through the first week of this
OL,8,Fperiod, bringing a lot of dry weather.
OL,9,FCloud amounts will be variable and
OL,10,Fthough there should be some sunshine
OL,11,Fby day, some locations will likely see
OL,12,Fareas of fog, which once formed, could
OL,13,Fbe slow to clear or possibly linger
OL,14,Fall day. For most, temperatures look
OL,15,Fto be fairly close average, though it
OL,16,Fwill remain cold where any fog sticks
OL,17,Faround. Some overnight frost is likely
OL,18,Fwhere skies are clear and winds light.
OL,19,FBy the end of this period, there is a
OL,20,Fsignal for more unsettled or
OL,21,Fchangeable conditions to return,
OL,22,Falbeit with uncertain details
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fsurrounding this.
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
