OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 12 Nov to Thu 26 NovFAn
OL,6,Fincreasing chance of more unsettled
OL,7,Fconditions developing through the
OL,8,Flatter half of November, with a return
OL,9,Fto spells of rain and the potential
OL,10,Ffor strong winds at times. However,
OL,11,Fthe extent and location of the wettest
OL,12,Fand/or windiest areas is quite
OL,13,Funcertain. Overall, temperatures will
OL,14,Fprobably be near or a little above
OL,15,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
